        },
        {
          "text": "Te Bezaleli, Uri Huri mvi ma mva, suru Yuda­niari, ede afa Yehovani azile Musa tia ’diyi dria ra; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.22",
