              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "te Oholiaba Ahisamaki mvi, suru Daniniari, ovu tualu eri be, eri ovu onduou wura opapi aya ruaari, onduou onduaru, eri ’ba wura sopi bongo blururi pi ma ruaa, okalakokalari pie, ekaruri pie, bongo mile be nyiriaruri pieri.",
